 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "leases lists [start, end] pairs (start < end), each occupying one car during [start, end). Process reservations by start time (ties by input index). A car whose current reservation ends at or before the start is free. Give each reservation the smallest free car id; when no car is free, add a new car with the next id (ids start at 1). Return the car id of every reservation in input order.",
